  "extractionNotes": "Full-time employee; the employment start is not legible, so titles[0].from is a lower bound (the childcare-leave start, the employment existed before it). Childcare leave 2021-10-01..2023-10-01 (no sickness insurance from it); back at work 2023-10-02 using overdue annual leave; pregnancy sick pay (code B) 2024-01-01..2024-02-02, then sickness benefit until the birth (inferred). Employer remark: base for 10–11/2023 = the 2023 minimum wage (3600.00); for sick pay the 2024 minimum wage was applied, 4242.00 − 13.71% = 3660.42, i.e. the full-time floor. Birth 2024-05-22; the first ZAM had a wrong maternity start and was corrected to 2024-05-22..2024-10-08 and 2024-10-09..2025-05-20. Z-3 application date 2024-06-03 (12 days after birth), 52-week leave application signed by the father. Grant evidenced by the file label and the complete file; rate and base not printed (base expected at the floor, 3660.42 until the July 2024 minimum-wage change)."
